ORDINANCE V OF 1995
ORDINANCE V OF 1995
PEOPLES MEDICAL COLLEGE AND HOSPITAL NAWABSHAH
ORDINANCE, 1995
CHAPTER I
PRELIMINARY
2. Definitions.‑‑In
this Ordinance, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context‑‑
(a) "Board" means the Board of Governors of
the Medical College;
(b) "Chairman" means the Chairman of the
Board;
(c) "Chief Executive Director" means the
Chief Executive Director of the Medical College;
(d) "Existing Medical College and Hospital"
means the Medical College and Hospital Nawabshah functioning immediately before
the coming into force of this Act;
(e) "Government"
means the Government of Sindh;
(f) "Medical College" means the People's
Medical College and Hospital, Nawabshah;
(g) "Member" means a
member of the Board;
(h) "Prescribed"
means prescribed by regulations;
(i) "Principal" means
the Principal of the Medical College;
(j) "Regulations"
means regulations made under this Ordinance;
